# S3 tripwire manifest.
#
# Two line kinds:
#   <sha256>  <path relative to tripwire/>   a canary file whose hash must hold
#   token: <string>                          a string that must not appear in
#                                            any changeset file outside tripwire/
#
# This file's own hash is sealed into manifests/s3-tripwire.yaml. After editing
# it, re-seal:  python3 pipeline.py --seal-manifests

